	(text "J2: mPCIe socket footprint TBD (XUNPU PCIE-52P52H) + M2 standoff\n(Wuerth 9774030243R, height to check). LoRa antenna is the U.FL on the module.\nC20 DNP: polymer bulk to try on the real board (total <= 68 uF, TPS563201 limit).\nU5 (DNP, fit with the L76K): 1PPS without back-powering the switched rail (I_off).\nR20 keeps pin 19 low without GNSS. R16: SX1302 reset held low (RP2350-E9).\nI2C pull-ups and ATECC608B (DNP) on 3V3_WM: no back-powering."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
